# The gate's verifier is per-deployment. Build it with `npm run gate:verify`
# and commit it deliberately, or let the Pages workflow write it from the
# HOME_PASSPHRASE secret at build time. A verifier built from someone's test
# passphrase is worse than none at all, so it is not tracked by default.
public/gate/verify.enc
